  "translation": "Elisa ittura deg wexxam-is, imɣaran ituran ⟨את⟩ yid-s; yuzen ⟨את⟩ yiwen wergaz seg zdat-is; uqbel ad yiwḍel umazan ɣuṛ-es, yenna i yimɣaran: Ma twalam belli mmi-s n umekṛuḥ-agi yuzen ad yeṭṭef ⟨את⟩ yiqeddiw-iw? Wali mi ara yiwḍel umazan: rglem ⟨את⟩ tawwurt, ṭṭefmet ⟨את⟩ deg tewwurt: mači ṣṣut n yiḍarren n bab-as deg deffir-es?",
